  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Y5B57S7g\" id=\"link-0\">数据范围</h1><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-Uj5mMoF5\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-06CiBDag\">开发者可以访问客户哪些数据</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-oSSarmLS\">客户可以在授权阶段，选择其希望开放给开发者的数据范围，目前支持按 店铺/代理商账户 纬度选择</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-4NiR1hrT\"><br/></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-VKPNq1Ob\" id=\"link-1\">接口权限</h1><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-07LRQI8f\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0ZZciSNW\">开发者可以调用哪些接口</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-fOOqn7B9\">接口按照校验的严格程度分为三种类型</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t8e1ebf7-VKWXgMNj\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"875px\" style=\"width: 875px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-EAREHYiI\"><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-NUT2flAO\" span=\"1\" width=\"49.94285714285714%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-a2ITLKLS\" span=\"1\" width=\"49.94285714285714%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-LBKaYV7H\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-DnLYXYQO\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-rQ2JnDPA\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MISe9EIv\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-VBIC2FI8\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JcL8eHda\">解释</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-upsq0xuG\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-JiL1OFdF\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6AJRkix0\">公共接口</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-1FD5V8aX\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-d8tUxcj9\">只要成为开发者即可调用的接口，目前主要为一些基础的公共数据接口</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-wbF6Mjiv\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-qFGQMU8P\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3BrPHbTY\">免权限申请接口</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-Fc2oDMOk\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EDFvZW1s\">只要客户完成了授权，即可调用的接口，无需额外申请</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-CzmINDWv\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-RK8Cpdld\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lPONCDrb\">权限点校验接口</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"tc10e1ad-6FBjcKcH\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GkrGrUYV\">需要在开发者创建应用的时候，提前勾选相应权限，通过开放平台工作人员审批后，该应用将可调用这批权限点对应的接口</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-ryipYTSo\"><br/></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-aSTnQOcH\" id=\"link-2\">公共接口 及 免权限申请接口</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t8e1ebf7-fmAW0nYS\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"875px\" style=\"width: 875px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-JHUeNiHM\"><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-JMf9bV57\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.25714285714286%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-uXWMPkP8\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.25714285714286%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-Q1MBZb2w\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.25714285714286%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-N5SJeQP7\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-Nxsue0VK\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-q8ZIJlG4\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-toT9Gx38\">接口名</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-D96lLFdD\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jeaweyDq\">path</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-9Za8gKGm\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OH9TYfPh\">类型</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-ZPPa45Xu\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-JzQXkYpM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-o5ybv6Kl\">获取行业列表</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-ASrHgVRa\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MUJNZt18\">/open_api/2/tools/industry/get/</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-Zc3dPIDM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xRSVuUwd\">公共接口，无需鉴权</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-8XcZfnOy\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-zm1meIvc\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TPjjgzph\">获取授权时登录用户信息</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-MwNNxAkL\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wKkFooko\">/open_api/2/user/info/</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-3i6mPRXZ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-n7r0SJx3\">免权限申请接口，仅做授权关系鉴权，无需额外申请权限点</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-xEQD0rlk\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-qga8JN44\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OJgwWiuF\">获取千川投放账户基础信息</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-mdYedXo3\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xIYZ22su\">/open_api/2/advertiser/public_info/</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb871063-IddR5RcA\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Qi0lKcQm\">免权限申请接口，仅做授权关系鉴权，无需额外申请权限点</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-9VtQ4zu2\"><br/></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-51j12N7W\" id=\"link-3\">需要校验的接口及权限点</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-NN8kvgV8\">可直接阅读【权限点与接口关系】</p></div>",
